                    "args": {
                        "filename": "hawaii-packing-list.docx",
                        "content": "Packing List for Hawaii Vacation\n==============================\n\nBased on the vacation plans for Hawaii, the following items are recommended:\n\n**Essentials:\n- Passport\n- Plane ticket\n- Hotel reservation\n- Travel insurance\n- Driver's license\n- Credit cards\n- Cash\n\n**Clothing:\n- 3-4 tops\n- 2-3 pairs of shorts\n- 1-2 swimsuits\n- 1-2 light jackets\n- Undergarments\n- Socks\n- Comfortable walking shoes\n- Sandals\n- Dressier outfit for dinner at restaurants\n\n**Beach and Water:\n- Reef-safe sunscreen\n- Sunglasses\n- Beach towel\n- Snorkeling gear\n- Water shoes\n- Beach bag\n- Water bottle\n- Beach umbrella\n\n**Electronics:\n- Smartphone\n- Camera\n- Portable charger\n- Power adapter\n- Waterproof phone case\n- Beach speakers\n\n**Personal:\n- Toiletries\n- Insect repellent\n- First aid kit\n- Prescription medications\n- Contact lenses/glasses\n- Travel pillow\n\n**Miscellaneous:\n- Snacks\n- Water bottle\n- Travel documents\n- Map\n- Guidebook\n- Reef-safe sunscreen\n- Beach bag\n\n**Additional:\n- Light rain jacket\n- Collapsible cooler\n- Beach chairs\n- Beach toys\n- Water shoes\n- Water bottle\n\n**Notes:\n- Check weather forecast before departure\n- Pack light and leave extra space for souvenirs\n- Consider packing a small daypack for daily excursions\n\nThis list is based on typical 7-10 day vacation plans in Hawaii. Adjust according to specific activities and accommodations."
                    },
                    "id": "call_117c2dbad46d409b81e1de1b",
                    "placeholder_args": null
